.TP
.B NO_COLOR, TERM
Control automatic color selection.
.TP
.B COLUMNS, LINES
Fallback logo dimensions when the destination terminal size is unavailable.
COLUMNS also controls human-output wrapping.
.TP
.B HOME, XDG_CONFIG_HOME, XDG_STATE_HOME
User config, theme and recovery-state roots used by Dots.
.SH FILES
.TP
.B themes/ID/anodize.json
