.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
anodize create dusk \-\-color '#725ac1' \-\-dry\-run
anodize create dusk \-\-color '#725ac1' \-\-yes
anodize preview dusk
anodize edit dusk \-\-adjust saturation=12 \-\-dry\-run
anodize apply dusk \-\-dry\-run
anodize apply dusk \-\-yes
.fi
.SH EXIT STATUS
0: success or preview. 1: validation or operational failure. 2: argument usage
error.
.SH DEPENDENCIES
Bash 4.4 or newer, Python 3.11 or newer and existing POSIX Dots theme tools.
Build the private engine explicitly from the checkout using
\fBpython3 \-B tools/verify_anodize.py build\fR (installed Go 1.27.1).
Help, completion generation and completion queries need no Go engine.
There are no automatic builds or downloads.
